    "rating": 4.4,
    "reference": "ChIJ6ZNwH0k2yUwRfzP4rgR0gRM",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jennifer Armatys",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101664202558833724127/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK7GYxDP5k3_QtLSweER8EXSpKLXVhF0QHm_KjdayIViE9_TA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I recently visited Chocolat Favoris and was very disappointed with both the cleanliness and the service. When I arrived, there were no other customers, yet 3 maybe 4 employees were standing behind the counter laughing and chatting instead of maintaining the space. The dining area was dirty, and despite staying for about 40 minutes (with only a few customers coming in and no real rush), no one made any effort to clean or tidy up. The terrasse was closed, likely due to earlier rain, which left me with no choice but to eat inside. Unfortunately, the seating area wasn’t appealing either there was an old, filthy blanket draped over the sofa, which really added to the unkempt feel of the place. Overall, it didn’t seem like anyone cared about the atmosphere or customer experience.",
        "time": 1756659793,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Laura E",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107426294419203687104/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVQUS_xywKgbHVdCBtFnL95la9tvxC6X7am5y99AabSqloU65cK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "I had a gift card and the 2 staff members told me they can not tell me what I have in my gift card until I made a purchase. After they rang I didn’t have enough so I asked what I can buy for 10$ and she told me it’s not possible that I have to buy this.  I told her the gift card did not have enough. She could not find a solution so she brought her manager. Her manager also couldn’t find a solution so so I told her make a return so I could make my purchase. 20 minutes this took and the customer service was terrible. Don’t buy a gift card there scamming you here.  EDIT please train your staff that if they can not disclose the total on your gift card and you ring an item and you do not have enough , your staff can not tell your clients that they MUST buy the item.  Their response made no sense and I as a client told them to make the return so that I could purchase a less  expensive items.  the staff were not trained properly and I wont be going back and will reject any gift cards from this place.",
        "time": 1768926356,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Justin Melville",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107539224058465378988/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfmRXpZzG2xkqKHU5NzF5B_C1U1fjoQWGWnOB6dY5bP0rtFLPM6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Pretty nice place for ice cream and other chocolate themed desserts/snacks. Very rich with thick chocolate layers on the ice cream. I could only eat a medium before my sweet tooth was more than satisfied. Staff were helpful and pleasant. The line was pretty long when we got there around 8pm on a Friday.",
        "time": 1746234029,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Elissalde",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113335168256897321065/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI95Jm-3e3BDZKmaiZCOVm9-PQs8OrFx2v3AXJNAtyqra82Ug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We just stopped this morning to pick up a box of chocolate’s. They were not open until 11:00 I was expecting extended hours 2 days before Christmas. They were literally out of chocolates except a few that people don’t want. One person working,but not a problem as most people looked and left! They will be loosing money. Not great planning.",
        "time": 1766516897,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
